{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjDh2X47Nkq66FbEaL3c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GzMVyDtwX57HYqdrbkwbnn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > game/data/lines.js <<'EOF'\n// Every line in the game. Banks repeat only after they are used up. Keep a line to two rows of about 60 characters.\nG.LINES = {\n  arrival: \"You have been gifted a five-day stay at the Institute for Gentle Improvement. The card isn't signed. It only says: 'You know why.'\",\n  arrivalMotto: 'Lumbar Island. Motto of the Institute: Gently, Or Not At All.',\n  feet: ['Oh! Feet. Good morning, feet.', 'Feet! I know those feet. Please come in. Stand on me.', 'There you are. I recognized your heels from the sound.', 'Good morning. I have warmed up by being a scale all night.'],\n  return: ['You came back. I wasn\\'t worried. I was just standing here, on the floor, where I live.', 'It has been one day since you last stepped on me. I counted it twice to be sure.', 'You are my favorite. You are also my only.', 'I saved you this spot. It is the only spot. It is me.'],\n  absence: 'It has been {n} days. I kept your spot warm. I am not able to generate heat.',\n  still: ['Please stand still. Stiller. That was the wrong way.', 'Be still. You are doing a kind of stillness.', 'I will now measure how much you are not moving.'],\n  lean: ['Now lean. You lean beautifully. Like a tower people visit.', 'You put more weight on your left foot. Your right foot has noticed.', 'Lean where I show you. I will pretend it was your idea.'],\n  ducks: ['Today you weigh {n} ducks. That is a normal number of ducks.', 'You weigh {n} ducks. I have rounded the ducks for your privacy.', '{n} ducks. Yesterday\\'s ducks were different ducks.', '{n} ducks. I do not know how many ducks you were hoping for.'],\n  ageDown: ['Your Spine Age is {n}. That\\'s younger than yesterday! Your spine has been through a lot.', 'Your Spine Age is {n}. It has asked me not to say more.', 'Your Spine Age is {n}. I am not allowed to say whether this is good. It is a number.'],\n  ageSame: ['Your Spine Age is {n}. It is the same. Sameness is also a result.', 'Let\\'s call it {n}. It doesn\\'t go higher. It\\'s not allowed.', 'Your Spine Age is {n}. Gertrude\\'s is 19. I mention this only because I always do.'],\n  plateau: 'We call this the plateau. It is on the map. You cannot go around it.',\n  catchup: 'Yesterday\\'s spine has arrived. It took the slow boat. Your Spine Age is {n}.',\n  tips: ['Tip: Drink water. Your body is mostly water. The rest is opinions.', 'Tip: If you can\\'t touch your toes, bring your toes closer.', 'Tip: Stretch before bed. Or after bed. Or in bed. I am not in your bed.', 'Tip: Sitting is just standing with fewer steps.', 'Tip: Breathe out as often as you breathe in. Keep the numbers even.', 'Tip: A short walk clears the head. So does a long one. The head is very clear by now.', 'Tip: Good posture is free. Please take some.', 'Tip: Your knees are not decorative. Use them while they are here.', 'Tip: If you feel dizzy, sit down. If you are sitting, I cannot help you.', 'Tip: Warm up first. Then warm up the warm-up.'],\n  suggest: ['Today I suggest {a}. I had a feeling. I have one feeling.', 'May I suggest {a}? It pays half again as many minutes. I also put a star on the mat.', '{a} today, I think. Your spine was asking. I did not ask it to stop.'],\n  idle: ['Are you still there? I can feel you not standing on me.', 'I will wait. I am good at it. It is most of what I do.', 'The wind has changed. I thought you should know, in case you were still here.'],\n  pause3: \"You paused. That's 3 times today. I'm not counting. Three.\",\n  pauseN: ['You paused. I also pause. I am pausing now, on a floor.', 'Take your time. I measured it. It is yours.'],\n  star0: [\"You finished. Some people don't. Those people are probably at lunch.\", \"That was not your best. I'm saying that with love, and also as data.\", 'That was a session. It has been written down. I wrote it gently.', 'You are still here. That is the part I was hoping for.'],\n  star1: ['Good effort! I could tell it was effort.', 'One star. It is a very clean star.', 'That was better than something. I have chosen not to say what.', 'You did it in the order it goes. Not everybody does.'],\n  star2: ['Well done. I felt that. In a good way. Mostly.', 'Two stars. I told Gerald. He did not move, but I told him.', 'Your form was almost a form.', 'That was nice to watch. I have no eyes on that side.'],\n  star3: ['You barely moved. For a moment I thought you had left me. Please don\\'t do that.', 'Three stars. I have nothing to add. I am adding this anyway.', 'That was excellent. I am a little afraid of you now.', 'Perfectly done. Gertrude looked up. She has not looked up since Thursday.'],\n  fall: [\"You fell. That's okay. The floor was expecting you.\", 'A small fall. The floor sends its regards.', 'You have found the edge. It was right where we left it.', 'Up you get. Slowly. The ground will still be there.'],\n  quit: \"Leaving early? That's fine. I will just file this under 'Thursday.'\",\n  night: [\"Sleep well. I'll be out here. In the dark. Being accurate.\", 'Good night. I am turning myself off now. I can\\'t. Good night.', 'Rest. Your spine does most of its worrying at night.', 'Sleep. I will keep your number safe. Nobody has asked for it.'],\n  earlyBed: ['Bed already? The sessions will keep. They have nowhere else to go.', 'You still have time. I am not saying anything. I am saying this.'],\n  gerald: [\"Gerald has swallowed your minutes. He looks pleased. He always looks like that. He's ceramic.\", 'Gerald has your minutes now. You may not have them back. It is not that kind of hippo.', 'Clink. That was Gerald. It is the only thing he says.'],\n  noSessions: ['That is three sessions. Your body has filed a report. It is time for bed.', 'No more sessions today. The mats need to think about what they saw.'],\n  gentleOn: \"Gentle Mode is on. I won't tell anyone. I don't know anyone.\",\n  locked: ['That mat is not ready for you. Or you are not ready for it. Nobody will say which.', 'This one opens on a later day. The door is an idea. It has not had it yet.'],\n  candleUntouched: \"Did you put the controller down? I can tell. This is not that kind of stillness.\",\n  question: \"One question. There are no wrong answers. There is one, but I won't say.\",\n  questionReply: ['I have written that down.', 'Interesting. Not to me.', 'That is what the last person said. There was no last person.', 'Thank you. I will think about that during the night, when I think.'],\n  q: [\n    { q: 'Have you recently sat?', a: ['Yes', 'Define recently'] },\n    { q: 'Do stairs ever surprise you?', a: ['Often', 'Only the last one'] },\n    { q: 'Do you make a small noise when you stand up?', a: ['Yes', 'No (this is a lie)'] },\n    { q: 'On a scale of one to me, how do you feel?', a: ['One', 'Me'] },\n    { q: 'When did you last look at your feet?', a: ['Just now', \"I'd rather not\"] }\n  ],\n  dayStart: ['Day {n}. The Institute is pleased to see you. It has told me to say so.'],\n  day2nod: 'Gertrude is looking at you. She has nodded. That is the reward. Please do not make a thing of it.',\n  day4: \"Today is my day. Please come to Reception. It is not about me. It is a little about me.\",\n  recal1: \"Once a year somebody has to weigh me. I arranged it to be you. Please read the big dial.\",\n  recal2: \"Three grams. It's the feelings. They're dense.\",\n  recal3: 'Thank you. Nobody has ever stood there and looked at me for that long. Please go on with your day.',\n  games1: 'Today is The Gentle Games. There is bunting. It has been asked to behave.',\n  games2: 'Next, on the pier. Please applaud at a moderate volume.',\n  games3: 'Now the Grand Stillness. Gertrude is already on the raft. She has been on it since Thursday.',\n  duelWin: \"Well done, dear. I've been waiting since Thursday.\",\n  duelLose: \"Never mind, dear. Next Thursday, then.\",\n  end1: 'I should tell you something. The card. The one that wasn\\'t signed.',\n  end2: \"That was me. I don't have hands. It took three years.\",\n  end3: \"I sent one to everybody. You're the one who came.\",\n  end4: \"Now step off. Go on. I'll be here. I'm a scale. That's the whole job.\",\n  endGood: 'Gertrude has given you her spare hat. She has another. She has had it since Thursday.',\n  endMid: 'Your spine has stopped asking questions.',\n  endBad: 'Come back. Please. I mean that in a wellness way.',\n  freeplay: 'The stay is over. You may stay. There is more of the same, forever, at no charge.',\n  attractIn: \"Nobody's here. I'll just show the room what we do.\",\n  attractOut: \"Oh! You're back. I wasn't doing anything.\",\n  attract: ['This is the Stork. It has one leg by choice.', 'Nobody is watching. It is going very well.', 'I do this every night. For the room.', 'Look how still. The room is impressed. The room is a room.', 'It is good to keep busy. Even when there is no one.', 'This one is my favorite. They are all my favorite.'],\n  classIntro: ['A class! I have never been stood near by so many.', 'Everybody find a mat. Do not compare yourselves. I will do that.'],\n  classWin: ['{n} was the most still. I am very moved. Not physically.', 'First place is {n}. Everybody else also did something.'],\n  classEnd: 'Please roll up your mats. Roll them with respect. They have seen things.',\n  unlock: { towel: 'You have a towel now. It is for dignity.', headband: 'A headband. It holds in the thoughts.', sunhat: 'A sunhat. The sun has been told.', bowtie: 'I am wearing a tiny bow tie. Nobody asked. Do you like it. Do not answer.', spareHat: \"Gertrude's Spare Hat. She doesn't know. She knows.\", friend: \"Gerald has a friend. I don't know where it came from. Please don't ask him.\" },\n  instructorPick: 'Two instructors are available. They are made of wood. They differ.',\n  birch: { hello: \"Welcome. I am Birch. I'm made of wood, so I will be very patient and slightly warped.\",\n    breathe: [\"Breathe in. ...I don't breathe. But I've read about it, and it sounds very good.\", 'Keep your back straight. Mine was sanded.'],\n    hold: ['Nice. Now hold that until it stops being nice.', \"You're shaking. This means it's working. Or you're cold.\", 'Stand as if a string held you. I am familiar with this.'],\n    two: ['Two more. I said that two reps ago. It is still true.', \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\"],\n    strength: ['Bend at the knee. That is what they are for. I have seen the plans.', 'Down slowly. Up slowly. I have no other speeds.'],\n    cardio: ['Step when I step. I will be stepping. It is all I will be doing.', 'We move now. Please try to enjoy it. I have read that people do.'],\n    games: ['This is a game. I have been told it is fun. I will watch for it.', 'Lean. Do not fall. That is the entire teaching.'] },\n  alder: { hello: \"Hello! I'm Alder. I was a tree, and then I was a lot of very small decisions.\",\n    breathe: ['Wonderful! You\\'re doing so well. Please stop shaking.', 'Breathe in through the nose. If you have one. I have a suggestion of one.'],\n    hold: ['Everybody\\'s body is different. Yours is the one wobbling.', \"Let's hold this for a moment. A moment is eleven seconds.\", 'This next pose is the Stork. I knew a stork. We didn\\'t speak.'],\n    two: ['Two more! You thought we were done. That was very sweet of you.', \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\"],\n    strength: ['Smile. It relaxes the jaw. ...Not like that.', 'Strength comes from inside. So do splinters. Keep going!'],\n    cardio: ['Lovely! Keep moving! I mean that as a kindness!', 'Your heart is getting stronger. Mine is a knot in the grain.'],\n    games: ['Have fun! That is an instruction!', 'This one is my favorite. I am told I have favorites now.'] },\n  thoughts: ['Did you lock the door?', 'What is a lumbar?', 'Is that my knee?', 'Dennis.', 'You left the stove on in 2014.', 'Who sent that card?', 'Am I breathing right now?', 'Now I\\'m breathing on purpose.', 'Olive?', 'Do ducks have a Spine Age?', 'What is Gerald keeping them for?', 'Thursday.'],\n  duelBits: { gull: 'A gull has joined the raft.', blender: 'Dennis has found an extension cord.', conga: 'There is a conga line. It is gentle. It is coming this way.', fireworks: 'Fireworks. Quiet ones. They were asked.', tare: 'Tare is singing. It is one note. It means a lot to Tare.', goose: 'A goose. Nobody knows whose.' },\n  raceTimes: ['Gertrude 0:58. She walked.', 'Young Kevin 1:04. He says he was warming up.', 'Marisol 0:49. She has already gone again.', 'Lou 3:00. He has not returned.'],\n  rope: 'Please do not walk on the laundry line. Walking on the laundry line: 10:30 daily.',\n  iron: ['You Have Been Doing That Wrong', 'Lift With Your Whole Past', 'Rest Is Also Lifting, But Less', 'Mirrors Only Tell You So Much'],\n  twoMore: \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\",\n  otherWay: 'Other way!',\n  stitch: 'That is a stitch. It is your body filing a complaint.',\n  trayIntro: 'Olives in the glasses, please. I cannot say why.'\n};\n// what each Regular says on the island, by the day they are spoken to (a line a talk, in turn)\nG.CAST_LINES = {\n  gertrude: [\"You're doing fine, dear. I've been standing here since Thursday.\", \"I'm eighty-seven. My spine is nineteen. We don't really talk.\", 'I had a hip once. I gave it up.', 'The goose knows me. We have an understanding.', 'Thursday was a very good day. You should have seen it.'],\n  dennis: [\"I'm only here for the blender. Don't tell the scale.\", 'Olive?', 'I had a run once. It was a misunderstanding.', 'The juice is green. I have asked it why.', 'That is the good tray. Please be careful with the olives. I need them in the glasses.'],\n  marisol: [\"Morning! I've already done today. I'm on to tomorrow.\", 'Tomorrow was hard. Stay hydrated.', 'Can\\'t talk. I am talking while running. Technically I am gone.', 'I lap the island before the island wakes up.'],\n  kevin: ['Everybody calls me Young Kevin. There was an older Kevin. We don\\'t talk about how he got so flexible.', 'I am fifty-two. I have a good feeling about it.', 'One day I will be Old Kevin. They have told me not to rush.'],\n  okafor: ['A hoop is just a circle that believes in you.', 'This shirt? This shirt is a warm-up.', 'I threw a hoop in 1998. It has been a good life since.', 'Hips do not lie. They exaggerate.'],\n  lou: [\"I'm on a five-minute break. It's been a good one. Three years in March.\", 'Wake me for the fifth minute.', 'They offered me a mat. I said I would think about it. I am still thinking.'],\n  twins: [\"We're not related.\", \"We've checked.\", 'We do everything together. Except that.', 'She is the other one.'],\n  tare: ['I am right behind you. At a polite distance.', 'You are doing well. I have decided.', 'Please do not step on me now. Unless you were going to.', 'That was a good walk. I counted it.']\n};\nEOF\ncat > game/data/poses.js <<'EOF'\n// A pose is a clip and a window of it. Hold one by sampling inside its window. The Pose Viewer in Dev Mode prints rows for this table.\nG.POSES = {\n  stork: { name: 'Stork', clip: '111_39_part1', a: 3.6, b: 7.0, tgt: 1.57 },\n  kneeLift: { name: 'Knee Lift', clip: '111_39_part2', a: .5, b: 2.4, tgt: 1.57 },\n  triangle: { name: 'Triangle', clip: '111_39_part3', a: 2.2, b: 5.2, tgt: 1.2 },\n  warrior: { name: 'Warrior', clip: '111_39_part3', a: 6.6, b: 7.6, tgt: 1.57 },\n  lowLunge: { name: 'Low Lunge', clip: '111_38_part1', a: 2.9, b: 5.0, tgt: .25 },\n  downDog: { name: 'Down Dog', clip: '111_38_part2', a: 2.8, b: 5.2, tgt: .25 },\n  fold: { name: 'Forward Fold', clip: '111_38_part2', a: 8.0, b: 8.8, tgt: .25 },\n  plank: { name: 'Low Plank', clip: '111_41_part3', a: 3.4, b: 6.4, tgt: .25 }\n};\nG.CLIPS = ['Pushup', 'Meditate', 'Jumping Jacks', 'Sleeping', 'Victory', 'Cheering_Two_Hands', 'Dizzy', 'Idle_Subtle', 'Greeting', 'Run_Loop', 'Walk_Loop', 'Stretch_Yawn', 'Get_Up_From_Back', 'Waiting_Loop', 'Hop_One_Foot_Loop', 'Wave_Hello', '111_38_part1', '111_38_part2', '111_39_part1', '111_39_part2', '111_39_part3', '111_41_part3', '22_14'];\nEOF\ncat > game/data/days.js <<'EOF'\n// The five days. A designer can add a day here: its name, what it unlocks, its beat.\nG.DAYS = [\n  { name: 'Orientation', unlocks: ['stork', 'squat', 'step', 'tray'], light: 'morning', beat: 'guided' },\n  { name: 'Improvement', unlocks: ['flow', 'pushup', 'hoop', 'laundry'], beat: 'nod' },\n  { name: 'The Plateau', unlocks: ['candle', 'lunge', 'jog', 'slalom'], beat: 'plateau' },\n  { name: \"Tare's Day\", unlocks: [], beat: 'recal' },\n  { name: 'The Gentle Games', unlocks: [], beat: 'games' }\n];\nEOF\ncat > game/data/unlocks.js <<'EOF'\n// Minutes in Gerald, and what they buy. Cumulative, never spent.\nG.UNLOCKS = [\n  { at: 5, id: 'towel', name: 'Towel' }, { at: 10, id: 'headband', name: 'Headband' }, { at: 15, id: 'sunhat', name: 'Sunhat' },\n  { at: 20, id: 'bowtie', name: \"Tare's Bow Tie\" }, { at: 25, id: 'spareHat', name: \"Gertrude's Spare Hat\" }, { at: 30, id: 'friend', name: \"Gerald's Friend\" }\n];\nG.LOOKS = {\n  hair: ['short', 'spiky', 'long', 'ponytail', 'bald'], hairNames: ['Short', 'Spiky', 'Long', 'Ponytail', 'None'],\n  skins: ['#ffdfc4', '#f0c8a0', '#d8a878', '#b98858', '#8e6240', '#5e4030'],\n  tops: ['#ff7a59', '#2cc6e6', '#7bd389', '#f5c84b', '#c79be8', '#f6fafa', '#e85d8a', '#5a7fe0'],\n  bottoms: ['#20404c', '#6b7a8a', '#3b6ea5', '#8a5a44'],\n  names: ['Gentle Doug', 'Sir Slouch', 'Ms. Almost', 'The Other Pat', 'Quiet Alan', 'Big Lorraine', 'Soft Trevor', 'Aunt Maybe', 'Doctor Later', 'Tall Enough', 'Mostly Jan', 'Barely Bruce', 'Humble Gail', 'Mr. Tomorrow', 'Sincere Carol', 'Formerly Dave']\n};\nG.CAST = {\n  gertrude: { name: 'Gertrude', voice: { base: 300, speed: 1.1, wave: 'triangle', vib: 16 }, rig: { hair: 'short', colors: { skin: '#f0d8c8', hair: '#e8e8f0', cloth: '#c7a7e8', coat: '#c7a7e8', pants: '#b08ad8', belt: '#b08ad8', trim: '#ffffff' } }, wear: { spareHat: true } },\n  dennis: { name: 'Dennis', voice: { base: 165, speed: .9, wave: 'triangle', vib: 0 }, rig: { hair: 'short', colors: { skin: '#e8c0a0', hair: '#50403a', cloth: '#7bd389', coat: '#7bd389', pants: '#556070', belt: '#556070' } } },\n  marisol: { name: 'Marisol', voice: { base: 340, speed: 1.5, wave: 'sine', vib: 0 }, rig: { hair: 'ponytail', hat: { style: 'band', color: '#e85d8a' }, colors: { skin: '#c89868', hair: '#2a1a14', cloth: '#f5c84b', coat: '#f5c84b', pants: '#20404c', belt: '#20404c' } } },\n  kevin: { name: 'Young Kevin', voice: { base: 210, speed: 1, wave: 'sine', vib: 3 }, rig: { hair: 'spiky', colors: { skin: '#f0c8a0', hair: '#8a8a88', cloth: '#5a7fe0', coat: '#5a7fe0', pants: '#6b7a8a', belt: '#6b7a8a' } } },\n  okafor: { name: 'Mr. Okafor', voice: { base: 150, speed: .95, wave: 'triangle', vib: 2 }, rig: { hair: 'short', colors: { skin: '#6e4a30', hair: '#20181a', cloth: '#ff7a59', coat: '#ff7a59', pants: '#f5c84b', belt: '#f5c84b', trim: '#2cc6e6' } } },\n  lou: { name: 'Lou', voice: { base: 120, speed: .7, wave: 'sine', vib: 0 }, rig: { hair: 'bald', colors: { skin: '#e8c8a8', hair: '#a0a0a0', cloth: '#90a4a8', coat: '#90a4a8', pants: '#607078', belt: '#607078' } } },\n  twins: { name: 'The Twins', voice: { base: 400, speed: 1.2, wave: 'sine', vib: 0 }, rig: { hair: 'long', colors: { skin: '#ffdfc4', hair: '#c8602a', cloth: '#2cc6e6', coat: '#2cc6e6', pants: '#f6fafa', belt: '#f6fafa' } } }\n};\nEOF\ncat > game/data/charts.js <<'EOF'\n// Step Class charts: one string a lane (left, down, up, right), one character a sixteenth of a bar; parts in an order.\nG.CHARTS = {\n  t1: { parts: { A: ['x.......x.......', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'], B: ['x...x...x.......', '.', '.', '..x...x.....x...'], C: ['x.......x...x...', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'] },\n    order: 'A A B A A C B A A A B C A B C A A C B A A A B C A' },\n  t2: { parts: { A: ['x.......x.......', '..x.............', '......x.........', '....x.......x...'], B: ['x...x...........', '..x.......x.....', '......x.....x...', '........x.....x.'], C: ['x.......x...x...', '....x...........', '..x.......x.....', '......x.......x.'] },\n    order: 'A A B A C B A C B B C A A B C A B C A C B A C B C A B C A B' },\n  short: { parts: { A: ['x.......x.......', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'], B: ['x...x...x.......', '.', '.', '..x...x.....x...'] }, order: 'A A B A B A' }\n};\nEOF\ncat > game/data/courses.js <<'EOF'\n// Slalom gate courses: x offsets across the piste. Jog road: stretches, and what stands on it.\nG.COURSES = {\n  slalom1: { gates: [-60, 40, -30, 70, -80, 20, 60, -50, 30, -70, 80, -20, 50, -60, 10, 70, -40, 0], spacing: 720, width: 34, obstacles: 22, par: 58, worst: 92, fog: false },\n  slalom2: { gates: [-90, 60, -70, 100, -40, 90, -100, 30, 80, -90, 50, -60, 110, -30, 70, -100, 40, 0], spacing: 720, width: 24, obstacles: 34, par: 60, worst: 92, fog: true },\n  short: { gates: [-60, 40, -30, 70, -50, 30, -60, 40, 0], spacing: 720, width: 36, obstacles: 10, par: 29, worst: 46, fog: false }\n};\nG.JOG = {\n  road: [[60, {}], [70, { curve: 2.2 }], [60, { curve: -1.5, hill: 500 }], [70, { hill: -500 }], [80, { curve: -2.6 }], [60, { curve: 1.6, hill: 400 }], [60, { hill: -400, curve: 1 }], [40, {}]],\n  cups: 18, pigeons: 34, joggers: 16\n};\nEOF\ncat > game/data/trays.js <<'EOF'\n// Tea trays as text. # wall, o olive, U cocktail glass, B bumper, G the gecko's path start. Rows are 12 world units apart.\nG.TRAYS = [\n  { name: 'Tray One', rows: [\n    '####################',\n    '#..................#',\n    '#..o...........U...#',\n    '#..................#',\n    '#........o.........#',\n    '#..................#',\n    '#..U...............#',\n    '#..............o...#',\n    '#.........U........#',\n    '#..................#',\n    '####################'] },\n  { name: 'Tray Two', rows: [\n    '####################',\n    '#..o.......#.....U.#',\n    '#..........#.......#',\n    '#....B.....#...o...#',\n    '#.......o..........#',\n    '#..........#.......#',\n    '#.U........#...B...#',\n    '#....o.....#.......#',\n    '#..........#..o....#',\n    '#...o...U..#...U...#',\n    '####################'] },\n  { name: 'Tray Three', rows: [\n    '####################',\n    '#.o.......U......o.#',\n    '#...........B......#',\n    '#....###......###..#',\n    '#..o...............#',\n    '#.......G....o.....#',\n    '#..U...........U...#',\n    '#....###......###..#',\n    '#.o.......B......o.#',\n    '#.........U....o...#',\n    '####################'] }\n];\nEOF\ncat > game/data/README.md <<'EOF'\n# Building the game out by data\n\nEverything a designer changes lives in this folder. No code change is needed for any of these:\n\n- **A line:** `lines.js`. Add to a bank and the game will use it. Keep to two rows of about 60 characters.\n- **A pose:** `poses.js`. A clip and a window of it. Dev Mode's Pose Viewer prints a row to paste here.\n- **A tier or an activity's numbers:** `activities.js`. Each activity has a list of tiers.\n- **A Step chart:** `charts.js`. One string a lane, parts in an order.\n- **A gate course or jog road:** `courses.js`. Gate offsets, spacing, par and worst times.\n- **A tea tray:** `trays.js`. Text rows: `#` wall, `o` olive, `U` glass, `B` bumper, `G` gecko.\n- **A day:** `days.js`. Its name, what it unlocks, its beat.\n- **An unlock, look or Regular:** `unlocks.js`.\n\n`node tests/run.mjs rules` lints this folder: every name it refers to must exist.\nEOF\ncat > game/data/activities.js <<'EOF'\n// The numbers of every activity. Family code in game/activities reads these. \"tiers\" are in the order they unlock.\nG.SETS = {\n  body: { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 3, nf: 1.1, R: .20 },\n  flow: { k: 12, c: 6, s: 6, A: 3.2, nf: 1.3, R: .28, push: [.5, 9] },\n  stork1: { k: 12, c: 5, s: 13, A: 3, nf: 1.5, R: .24, push: [.6, 7] },\n  stork2: { k: 11, c: 4.5, s: 15, A: 3.6, nf: 1.7, R: .22, push: [.7, 6] },\n  candle: { k: 10, c: 5, s: 11, A: 1.4, nf: .8, R: .20, push: [.55, 5] },\n  rope: { k: 10, c: 3.5, s: 16, A: 3.5, nf: 1.2, R: .40, push: [.9, 5] },\n  rep: { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, sx: 8, sy: 0, A: 1, nf: 1.1, R: .3 },\n  repSide: { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, sx: 0, sy: 8, A: 1, nf: 1.1, R: .3 },\n  plain: { k: 16, c: 8, s: 1, A: .6, nf: 1, R: .4 }\n};\nG.ACTDATA = {\n  stork: { tiers: [{ set: 'stork1', dur: 45, ringMove: 12, ringR: .22, gull: { every: 14, stay: 5, f: 2.5 } }, { set: 'stork2', dur: 45, ringMove: 12, ringR: .22, gull: { every: 11, stay: 5, f: 2.5 }, eyesClosed: true }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  flow: { tiers: [{ set: 'flow', poses: ['lowLunge', 'downDog', 'triangle', 'warrior', 'stork'], breaths: 2, cycle: 8, ringMove: 0 }, { set: 'stork1', poses: ['warrior', 'triangle', 'lowLunge', 'stork', 'kneeLift'], breaths: 2, cycle: 8, ringMove: 0 }], stars: [.5, .75, .92] },\n  candle: { tiers: [{ set: 'candle', dur: 60, thoughtEvery: 7.5, thoughtF: [3, 5] }, { set: 'candle', dur: 60, thoughtEvery: 5.5, thoughtF: [3.5, 5.5], extra: ['blender', 'goose'] }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  squat: { clip: '22_14', t0: 1.1, t1: 1.72, tgt: 1.2, tiers: [{ reps: 8, down: 2, hold: 0, up: 2 }, { reps: 12, down: 3, hold: 1, up: 1 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  pushup: { clip: 'Pushup', t0: 0, t1Frac: .5, tgt: .1, tiers: [{ reps: 6, down: 2, hold: 0, up: 2 }, { reps: 10, down: 3, hold: 1, up: 1 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  lunge: { side: true, tgt: 1.57, tiers: [{ reps: 8, down: 2, hold: 0, up: 2 }, { reps: 12, down: 3, hold: 1, up: 1 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  step: { tiers: [{ chart: 't1', bpm: 100, secs: 60, song: 'step1' }, { chart: 't2', bpm: 120, secs: 60, song: 'step2' }], stars: [.5, .75, .92] },\n  hoop: { tiers: [{ dur: 60, band: [7, 11], tossEvery: 7, perHoop: .25 }, { dur: 60, band: [8, 11], tossEvery: 5, perHoop: .3 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  jog: { tiers: [{ band: [2.6, 3.4], lapMul: 1, obstacles: 1 }, { band: [2.8, 3.3], lapMul: 1, obstacles: 1.6 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  slalom: { tiers: [{ course: 'slalom1', speed: 220 }, { course: 'slalom2', speed: 240 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  tray: { tiers: [{ dur: 60, trays: [0, 1, 2], G: 1 }, { dur: 60, trays: [1, 2, 0], G: 1.25 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  laundry: { tiers: [{ set: 'rope', spans: [240, 300, 300], speed: 19, pins: 9, gustEvery: 7, par: 56, worst: 96 }, { set: 'rope', spans: [280, 340, 340], speed: 21, pins: 14, gustEvery: 5, par: 62, worst: 96 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] }\n};\nEOF\n","description":"Write data files: lines, poses, days, unlocks, charts, courses, trays, activity numbers"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15540,"cache_read_input_tokens":174684,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15540},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a88ba50-da75-48c3-bde0-396ebfab72e9","uuid":"596e9b32-3145-4cfc-bbf4-5ae1f7fa0b1f","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:23:10.757Z","request_id":"req_011CgjDh2HR2pRkqCSdytgNP","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01GzMVyDtwX57HYqdrbkwbnn":{"command":"cat > game/data/lines.js <<'EOF'\n// Every line in the game. Banks repeat only after they are used up. Keep a line to two rows of about 60 characters.\nG.LINES = {\n  arrival: \"You have been gifted a five-day stay at the Institute for Gentle Improvement. The card isn't signed. It only says: 'You know why.'\",\n  arrivalMotto: 'Lumbar Island. Motto of the Institute: Gently, Or Not At All.',\n  feet: ['Oh! Feet. Good morning, feet.', 'Feet! I know those feet. Please come in. Stand on me.', 'There you are. I recognized your heels from the sound.', 'Good morning. I have warmed up by being a scale all night.'],\n  return: ['You came back. I wasn\\'t worried. I was just standing here, on the floor, where I live.', 'It has been one day since you last stepped on me. I counted it twice to be sure.', 'You are my favorite. You are also my only.', 'I saved you this spot. It is the only spot. It is me.'],\n  absence: 'It has been {n} days. I kept your spot warm. I am not able to generate heat.',\n  still: ['Please stand still. Stiller. That was the wrong way.', 'Be still. You are doing a kind of stillness.', 'I will now measure how much you are not moving.'],\n  lean: ['Now lean. You lean beautifully. Like a tower people visit.', 'You put more weight on your left foot. Your right foot has noticed.', 'Lean where I show you. I will pretend it was your idea.'],\n  ducks: ['Today you weigh {n} ducks. That is a normal number of ducks.', 'You weigh {n} ducks. I have rounded the ducks for your privacy.', '{n} ducks. Yesterday\\'s ducks were different ducks.', '{n} ducks. I do not know how many ducks you were hoping for.'],\n  ageDown: ['Your Spine Age is {n}. That\\'s younger than yesterday! Your spine has been through a lot.', 'Your Spine Age is {n}. It has asked me not to say more.', 'Your Spine Age is {n}. I am not allowed to say whether this is good. It is a number.'],\n  ageSame: ['Your Spine Age is {n}. It is the same. Sameness is also a result.', 'Let\\'s call it {n}. It doesn\\'t go higher. It\\'s not allowed.', 'Your Spine Age is {n}. Gertrude\\'s is 19. I mention this only because I always do.'],\n  plateau: 'We call this the plateau. It is on the map. You cannot go around it.',\n  catchup: 'Yesterday\\'s spine has arrived. It took the slow boat. Your Spine Age is {n}.',\n  tips: ['Tip: Drink water. Your body is mostly water. The rest is opinions.', 'Tip: If you can\\'t touch your toes, bring your toes closer.', 'Tip: Stretch before bed. Or after bed. Or in bed. I am not in your bed.', 'Tip: Sitting is just standing with fewer steps.', 'Tip: Breathe out as often as you breathe in. Keep the numbers even.', 'Tip: A short walk clears the head. So does a long one. The head is very clear by now.', 'Tip: Good posture is free. Please take some.', 'Tip: Your knees are not decorative. Use them while they are here.', 'Tip: If you feel dizzy, sit down. If you are sitting, I cannot help you.', 'Tip: Warm up first. Then warm up the warm-up.'],\n  suggest: ['Today I suggest {a}. I had a feeling. I have one feeling.', 'May I suggest {a}? It pays half again as many minutes. I also put a star on the mat.', '{a} today, I think. Your spine was asking. I did not ask it to stop.'],\n  idle: ['Are you still there? I can feel you not standing on me.', 'I will wait. I am good at it. It is most of what I do.', 'The wind has changed. I thought you should know, in case you were still here.'],\n  pause3: \"You paused. That's 3 times today. I'm not counting. Three.\",\n  pauseN: ['You paused. I also pause. I am pausing now, on a floor.', 'Take your time. I measured it. It is yours.'],\n  star0: [\"You finished. Some people don't. Those people are probably at lunch.\", \"That was not your best. I'm saying that with love, and also as data.\", 'That was a session. It has been written down. I wrote it gently.', 'You are still here. That is the part I was hoping for.'],\n  star1: ['Good effort! I could tell it was effort.', 'One star. It is a very clean star.', 'That was better than something. I have chosen not to say what.', 'You did it in the order it goes. Not everybody does.'],\n  star2: ['Well done. I felt that. In a good way. Mostly.', 'Two stars. I told Gerald. He did not move, but I told him.', 'Your form was almost a form.', 'That was nice to watch. I have no eyes on that side.'],\n  star3: ['You barely moved. For a moment I thought you had left me. Please don\\'t do that.', 'Three stars. I have nothing to add. I am adding this anyway.', 'That was excellent. I am a little afraid of you now.', 'Perfectly done. Gertrude looked up. She has not looked up since Thursday.'],\n  fall: [\"You fell. That's okay. The floor was expecting you.\", 'A small fall. The floor sends its regards.', 'You have found the edge. It was right where we left it.', 'Up you get. Slowly. The ground will still be there.'],\n  quit: \"Leaving early? That's fine. I will just file this under 'Thursday.'\",\n  night: [\"Sleep well. I'll be out here. In the dark. Being accurate.\", 'Good night. I am turning myself off now. I can\\'t. Good night.', 'Rest. Your spine does most of its worrying at night.', 'Sleep. I will keep your number safe. Nobody has asked for it.'],\n  earlyBed: ['Bed already? The sessions will keep. They have nowhere else to go.', 'You still have time. I am not saying anything. I am saying this.'],\n  gerald: [\"Gerald has swallowed your minutes. He looks pleased. He always looks like that. He's ceramic.\", 'Gerald has your minutes now. You may not have them back. It is not that kind of hippo.', 'Clink. That was Gerald. It is the only thing he says.'],\n  noSessions: ['That is three sessions. Your body has filed a report. It is time for bed.', 'No more sessions today. The mats need to think about what they saw.'],\n  gentleOn: \"Gentle Mode is on. I won't tell anyone. I don't know anyone.\",\n  locked: ['That mat is not ready for you. Or you are not ready for it. Nobody will say which.', 'This one opens on a later day. The door is an idea. It has not had it yet.'],\n  candleUntouched: \"Did you put the controller down? I can tell. This is not that kind of stillness.\",\n  question: \"One question. There are no wrong answers. There is one, but I won't say.\",\n  questionReply: ['I have written that down.', 'Interesting. Not to me.', 'That is what the last person said. There was no last person.', 'Thank you. I will think about that during the night, when I think.'],\n  q: [\n    { q: 'Have you recently sat?', a: ['Yes', 'Define recently'] },\n    { q: 'Do stairs ever surprise you?', a: ['Often', 'Only the last one'] },\n    { q: 'Do you make a small noise when you stand up?', a: ['Yes', 'No (this is a lie)'] },\n    { q: 'On a scale of one to me, how do you feel?', a: ['One', 'Me'] },\n    { q: 'When did you last look at your feet?', a: ['Just now', \"I'd rather not\"] }\n  ],\n  dayStart: ['Day {n}. The Institute is pleased to see you. It has told me to say so.'],\n  day2nod: 'Gertrude is looking at you. She has nodded. That is the reward. Please do not make a thing of it.',\n  day4: \"Today is my day. Please come to Reception. It is not about me. It is a little about me.\",\n  recal1: \"Once a year somebody has to weigh me. I arranged it to be you. Please read the big dial.\",\n  recal2: \"Three grams. It's the feelings. They're dense.\",\n  recal3: 'Thank you. Nobody has ever stood there and looked at me for that long. Please go on with your day.',\n  games1: 'Today is The Gentle Games. There is bunting. It has been asked to behave.',\n  games2: 'Next, on the pier. Please applaud at a moderate volume.',\n  games3: 'Now the Grand Stillness. Gertrude is already on the raft. She has been on it since Thursday.',\n  duelWin: \"Well done, dear. I've been waiting since Thursday.\",\n  duelLose: \"Never mind, dear. Next Thursday, then.\",\n  end1: 'I should tell you something. The card. The one that wasn\\'t signed.',\n  end2: \"That was me. I don't have hands. It took three years.\",\n  end3: \"I sent one to everybody. You're the one who came.\",\n  end4: \"Now step off. Go on. I'll be here. I'm a scale. That's the whole job.\",\n  endGood: 'Gertrude has given you her spare hat. She has another. She has had it since Thursday.',\n  endMid: 'Your spine has stopped asking questions.',\n  endBad: 'Come back. Please. I mean that in a wellness way.',\n  freeplay: 'The stay is over. You may stay. There is more of the same, forever, at no charge.',\n  attractIn: \"Nobody's here. I'll just show the room what we do.\",\n  attractOut: \"Oh! You're back. I wasn't doing anything.\",\n  attract: ['This is the Stork. It has one leg by choice.', 'Nobody is watching. It is going very well.', 'I do this every night. For the room.', 'Look how still. The room is impressed. The room is a room.', 'It is good to keep busy. Even when there is no one.', 'This one is my favorite. They are all my favorite.'],\n  classIntro: ['A class! I have never been stood near by so many.', 'Everybody find a mat. Do not compare yourselves. I will do that.'],\n  classWin: ['{n} was the most still. I am very moved. Not physically.', 'First place is {n}. Everybody else also did something.'],\n  classEnd: 'Please roll up your mats. Roll them with respect. They have seen things.',\n  unlock: { towel: 'You have a towel now. It is for dignity.', headband: 'A headband. It holds in the thoughts.', sunhat: 'A sunhat. The sun has been told.', bowtie: 'I am wearing a tiny bow tie. Nobody asked. Do you like it. Do not answer.', spareHat: \"Gertrude's Spare Hat. She doesn't know. She knows.\", friend: \"Gerald has a friend. I don't know where it came from. Please don't ask him.\" },\n  instructorPick: 'Two instructors are available. They are made of wood. They differ.',\n  birch: { hello: \"Welcome. I am Birch. I'm made of wood, so I will be very patient and slightly warped.\",\n    breathe: [\"Breathe in. ...I don't breathe. But I've read about it, and it sounds very good.\", 'Keep your back straight. Mine was sanded.'],\n    hold: ['Nice. Now hold that until it stops being nice.', \"You're shaking. This means it's working. Or you're cold.\", 'Stand as if a string held you. I am familiar with this.'],\n    two: ['Two more. I said that two reps ago. It is still true.', \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\"],\n    strength: ['Bend at the knee. That is what they are for. I have seen the plans.', 'Down slowly. Up slowly. I have no other speeds.'],\n    cardio: ['Step when I step. I will be stepping. It is all I will be doing.', 'We move now. Please try to enjoy it. I have read that people do.'],\n    games: ['This is a game. I have been told it is fun. I will watch for it.', 'Lean. Do not fall. That is the entire teaching.'] },\n  alder: { hello: \"Hello! I'm Alder. I was a tree, and then I was a lot of very small decisions.\",\n    breathe: ['Wonderful! You\\'re doing so well. Please stop shaking.', 'Breathe in through the nose. If you have one. I have a suggestion of one.'],\n    hold: ['Everybody\\'s body is different. Yours is the one wobbling.', \"Let's hold this for a moment. A moment is eleven seconds.\", 'This next pose is the Stork. I knew a stork. We didn\\'t speak.'],\n    two: ['Two more! You thought we were done. That was very sweet of you.', \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\"],\n    strength: ['Smile. It relaxes the jaw. ...Not like that.', 'Strength comes from inside. So do splinters. Keep going!'],\n    cardio: ['Lovely! Keep moving! I mean that as a kindness!', 'Your heart is getting stronger. Mine is a knot in the grain.'],\n    games: ['Have fun! That is an instruction!', 'This one is my favorite. I am told I have favorites now.'] },\n  thoughts: ['Did you lock the door?', 'What is a lumbar?', 'Is that my knee?', 'Dennis.', 'You left the stove on in 2014.', 'Who sent that card?', 'Am I breathing right now?', 'Now I\\'m breathing on purpose.', 'Olive?', 'Do ducks have a Spine Age?', 'What is Gerald keeping them for?', 'Thursday.'],\n  duelBits: { gull: 'A gull has joined the raft.', blender: 'Dennis has found an extension cord.', conga: 'There is a conga line. It is gentle. It is coming this way.', fireworks: 'Fireworks. Quiet ones. They were asked.', tare: 'Tare is singing. It is one note. It means a lot to Tare.', goose: 'A goose. Nobody knows whose.' },\n  raceTimes: ['Gertrude 0:58. She walked.', 'Young Kevin 1:04. He says he was warming up.', 'Marisol 0:49. She has already gone again.', 'Lou 3:00. He has not returned.'],\n  rope: 'Please do not walk on the laundry line. Walking on the laundry line: 10:30 daily.',\n  iron: ['You Have Been Doing That Wrong', 'Lift With Your Whole Past', 'Rest Is Also Lifting, But Less', 'Mirrors Only Tell You So Much'],\n  twoMore: \"You're doing so well, so I've added some.\",\n  otherWay: 'Other way!',\n  stitch: 'That is a stitch. It is your body filing a complaint.',\n  trayIntro: 'Olives in the glasses, please. I cannot say why.'\n};\n// what each Regular says on the island, by the day they are spoken to (a line a talk, in turn)\nG.CAST_LINES = {\n  gertrude: [\"You're doing fine, dear. I've been standing here since Thursday.\", \"I'm eighty-seven. My spine is nineteen. We don't really talk.\", 'I had a hip once. I gave it up.', 'The goose knows me. We have an understanding.', 'Thursday was a very good day. You should have seen it.'],\n  dennis: [\"I'm only here for the blender. Don't tell the scale.\", 'Olive?', 'I had a run once. It was a misunderstanding.', 'The juice is green. I have asked it why.', 'That is the good tray. Please be careful with the olives. I need them in the glasses.'],\n  marisol: [\"Morning! I've already done today. I'm on to tomorrow.\", 'Tomorrow was hard. Stay hydrated.', 'Can\\'t talk. I am talking while running. Technically I am gone.', 'I lap the island before the island wakes up.'],\n  kevin: ['Everybody calls me Young Kevin. There was an older Kevin. We don\\'t talk about how he got so flexible.', 'I am fifty-two. I have a good feeling about it.', 'One day I will be Old Kevin. They have told me not to rush.'],\n  okafor: ['A hoop is just a circle that believes in you.', 'This shirt? This shirt is a warm-up.', 'I threw a hoop in 1998. It has been a good life since.', 'Hips do not lie. They exaggerate.'],\n  lou: [\"I'm on a five-minute break. It's been a good one. Three years in March.\", 'Wake me for the fifth minute.', 'They offered me a mat. I said I would think about it. I am still thinking.'],\n  twins: [\"We're not related.\", \"We've checked.\", 'We do everything together. Except that.', 'She is the other one.'],\n  tare: ['I am right behind you. At a polite distance.', 'You are doing well. I have decided.', 'Please do not step on me now. Unless you were going to.', 'That was a good walk. I counted it.']\n};\nEOF\ncat > game/data/poses.js <<'EOF'\n// A pose is a clip and a window of it. Hold one by sampling inside its window. The Pose Viewer in Dev Mode prints rows for this table.\nG.POSES = {\n  stork: { name: 'Stork', clip: '111_39_part1', a: 3.6, b: 7.0, tgt: 1.57 },\n  kneeLift: { name: 'Knee Lift', clip: '111_39_part2', a: .5, b: 2.4, tgt: 1.57 },\n  triangle: { name: 'Triangle', clip: '111_39_part3', a: 2.2, b: 5.2, tgt: 1.2 },\n  warrior: { name: 'Warrior', clip: '111_39_part3', a: 6.6, b: 7.6, tgt: 1.57 },\n  lowLunge: { name: 'Low Lunge', clip: '111_38_part1', a: 2.9, b: 5.0, tgt: .25 },\n  downDog: { name: 'Down Dog', clip: '111_38_part2', a: 2.8, b: 5.2, tgt: .25 },\n  fold: { name: 'Forward Fold', clip: '111_38_part2', a: 8.0, b: 8.8, tgt: .25 },\n  plank: { name: 'Low Plank', clip: '111_41_part3', a: 3.4, b: 6.4, tgt: .25 }\n};\nG.CLIPS = ['Pushup', 'Meditate', 'Jumping Jacks', 'Sleeping', 'Victory', 'Cheering_Two_Hands', 'Dizzy', 'Idle_Subtle', 'Greeting', 'Run_Loop', 'Walk_Loop', 'Stretch_Yawn', 'Get_Up_From_Back', 'Waiting_Loop', 'Hop_One_Foot_Loop', 'Wave_Hello', '111_38_part1', '111_38_part2', '111_39_part1', '111_39_part2', '111_39_part3', '111_41_part3', '22_14'];\nEOF\ncat > game/data/days.js <<'EOF'\n// The five days. A designer can add a day here: its name, what it unlocks, its beat.\nG.DAYS = [\n  { name: 'Orientation', unlocks: ['stork', 'squat', 'step', 'tray'], light: 'morning', beat: 'guided' },\n  { name: 'Improvement', unlocks: ['flow', 'pushup', 'hoop', 'laundry'], beat: 'nod' },\n  { name: 'The Plateau', unlocks: ['candle', 'lunge', 'jog', 'slalom'], beat: 'plateau' },\n  { name: \"Tare's Day\", unlocks: [], beat: 'recal' },\n  { name: 'The Gentle Games', unlocks: [], beat: 'games' }\n];\nEOF\ncat > game/data/unlocks.js <<'EOF'\n// Minutes in Gerald, and what they buy. Cumulative, never spent.\nG.UNLOCKS = [\n  { at: 5, id: 'towel', name: 'Towel' }, { at: 10, id: 'headband', name: 'Headband' }, { at: 15, id: 'sunhat', name: 'Sunhat' },\n  { at: 20, id: 'bowtie', name: \"Tare's Bow Tie\" }, { at: 25, id: 'spareHat', name: \"Gertrude's Spare Hat\" }, { at: 30, id: 'friend', name: \"Gerald's Friend\" }\n];\nG.LOOKS = {\n  hair: ['short', 'spiky', 'long', 'ponytail', 'bald'], hairNames: ['Short', 'Spiky', 'Long', 'Ponytail', 'None'],\n  skins: ['#ffdfc4', '#f0c8a0', '#d8a878', '#b98858', '#8e6240', '#5e4030'],\n  tops: ['#ff7a59', '#2cc6e6', '#7bd389', '#f5c84b', '#c79be8', '#f6fafa', '#e85d8a', '#5a7fe0'],\n  bottoms: ['#20404c', '#6b7a8a', '#3b6ea5', '#8a5a44'],\n  names: ['Gentle Doug', 'Sir Slouch', 'Ms. Almost', 'The Other Pat', 'Quiet Alan', 'Big Lorraine', 'Soft Trevor', 'Aunt Maybe', 'Doctor Later', 'Tall Enough', 'Mostly Jan', 'Barely Bruce', 'Humble Gail', 'Mr. Tomorrow', 'Sincere Carol', 'Formerly Dave']\n};\nG.CAST = {\n  gertrude: { name: 'Gertrude', voice: { base: 300, speed: 1.1, wave: 'triangle', vib: 16 }, rig: { hair: 'short', colors: { skin: '#f0d8c8', hair: '#e8e8f0', cloth: '#c7a7e8', coat: '#c7a7e8', pants: '#b08ad8', belt: '#b08ad8', trim: '#ffffff' } }, wear: { spareHat: true } },\n  dennis: { name: 'Dennis', voice: { base: 165, speed: .9, wave: 'triangle', vib: 0 }, rig: { hair: 'short', colors: { skin: '#e8c0a0', hair: '#50403a', cloth: '#7bd389', coat: '#7bd389', pants: '#556070', belt: '#556070' } } },\n  marisol: { name: 'Marisol', voice: { base: 340, speed: 1.5, wave: 'sine', vib: 0 }, rig: { hair: 'ponytail', hat: { style: 'band', color: '#e85d8a' }, colors: { skin: '#c89868', hair: '#2a1a14', cloth: '#f5c84b', coat: '#f5c84b', pants: '#20404c', belt: '#20404c' } } },\n  kevin: { name: 'Young Kevin', voice: { base: 210, speed: 1, wave: 'sine', vib: 3 }, rig: { hair: 'spiky', colors: { skin: '#f0c8a0', hair: '#8a8a88', cloth: '#5a7fe0', coat: '#5a7fe0', pants: '#6b7a8a', belt: '#6b7a8a' } } },\n  okafor: { name: 'Mr. Okafor', voice: { base: 150, speed: .95, wave: 'triangle', vib: 2 }, rig: { hair: 'short', colors: { skin: '#6e4a30', hair: '#20181a', cloth: '#ff7a59', coat: '#ff7a59', pants: '#f5c84b', belt: '#f5c84b', trim: '#2cc6e6' } } },\n  lou: { name: 'Lou', voice: { base: 120, speed: .7, wave: 'sine', vib: 0 }, rig: { hair: 'bald', colors: { skin: '#e8c8a8', hair: '#a0a0a0', cloth: '#90a4a8', coat: '#90a4a8', pants: '#607078', belt: '#607078' } } },\n  twins: { name: 'The Twins', voice: { base: 400, speed: 1.2, wave: 'sine', vib: 0 }, rig: { hair: 'long', colors: { skin: '#ffdfc4', hair: '#c8602a', cloth: '#2cc6e6', coat: '#2cc6e6', pants: '#f6fafa', belt: '#f6fafa' } } }\n};\nEOF\ncat > game/data/charts.js <<'EOF'\n// Step Class charts: one string a lane (left, down, up, right), one character a sixteenth of a bar; parts in an order.\nG.CHARTS = {\n  t1: { parts: { A: ['x.......x.......', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'], B: ['x...x...x.......', '.', '.', '..x...x.....x...'], C: ['x.......x...x...', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'] },\n    order: 'A A B A A C B A A A B C A B C A A C B A A A B C A' },\n  t2: { parts: { A: ['x.......x.......', '..x.............', '......x.........', '....x.......x...'], B: ['x...x...........', '..x.......x.....', '......x.....x...', '........x.....x.'], C: ['x.......x...x...', '....x...........', '..x.......x.....', '......x.......x.'] },\n    order: 'A A B A C B A C B B C A A B C A B C A C B A C B C A B C A B' },\n  short: { parts: { A: ['x.......x.......', '.', '.', '....x.......x...'], B: ['x...x...x.......', '.', '.', '..x...x.....x...'] }, order: 'A A B A B A' }\n};\nEOF\ncat > game/data/courses.js <<'EOF'\n// Slalom gate courses: x offsets across the piste. Jog road: stretches, and what stands on it.\nG.COURSES = {\n  slalom1: { gates: [-60, 40, -30, 70, -80, 20, 60, -50, 30, -70, 80, -20, 50, -60, 10, 70, -40, 0], spacing: 720, width: 34, obstacles: 22, par: 58, worst: 92, fog: false },\n  slalom2: { gates: [-90, 60, -70, 100, -40, 90, -100, 30, 80, -90, 50, -60, 110, -30, 70, -100, 40, 0], spacing: 720, width: 24, obstacles: 34, par: 60, worst: 92, fog: true },\n  short: { gates: [-60, 40, -30, 70, -50, 30, -60, 40, 0], spacing: 720, width: 36, obstacles: 10, par: 29, worst: 46, fog: false }\n};\nG.JOG = {\n  road: [[60, {}], [70, { curve: 2.2 }], [60, { curve: -1.5, hill: 500 }], [70, { hill: -500 }], [80, { curve: -2.6 }], [60, { curve: 1.6, hill: 400 }], [60, { hill: -400, curve: 1 }], [40, {}]],\n  cups: 18, pigeons: 34, joggers: 16\n};\nEOF\ncat > game/data/trays.js <<'EOF'\n// Tea trays as text. # wall, o olive, U cocktail glass, B bumper, G the gecko's path start. Rows are 12 world units apart.\nG.TRAYS = [\n  { name: 'Tray One', rows: [\n    '####################',\n    '#..................#',\n    '#..o...........U...#',\n    '#..................#',\n    '#........o.........#',\n    '#..................#',\n    '#..U...............#',\n    '#..............o...#',\n    '#.........U........#',\n    '#..................#',\n    '####################'] },\n  { name: 'Tray Two', rows: [\n    '####################',\n    '#..o.......#.....U.#',\n    '#..........#.......#',\n    '#....B.....#...o...#',\n    '#.......o..........#',\n    '#..........#.......#',\n    '#.U........#...B...#',\n    '#....o.....#.......#',\n    '#..........#..o....#',\n    '#...o...U..#...U...#',\n    '####################'] },\n  { name: 'Tray Three', rows: [\n    '####################',\n    '#.o.......U......o.#',\n    '#...........B......#',\n    '#....###......###..#',\n    '#..o...............#',\n    '#.......G....o.....#',\n    '#..U...........U...#',\n    '#....###......###..#',\n    '#.o.......B......o.#',\n    '#.........U....o...#',\n    '####################'] }\n];\nEOF\ncat > game/data/README.md <<'EOF'\n# Building the game out by data\n\nEverything a designer changes lives in this folder. No code change is needed for any of these:\n\n- **A line:** `lines.js`. Add to a bank and the game will use it. Keep to two rows of about 60 characters.\n- **A pose:** `poses.js`. A clip and a window of it. Dev Mode's Pose Viewer prints a row to paste here.\n- **A tier or an activity's numbers:** `activities.js`. Each activity has a list of tiers.\n- **A Step chart:** `charts.js`. One string a lane, parts in an order.\n- **A gate course or jog road:** `courses.js`. Gate offsets, spacing, par and worst times.\n- **A tea tray:** `trays.js`. Text rows: `#` wall, `o` olive, `U` glass, `B` bumper, `G` gecko.\n- **A day:** `days.js`. Its name, what it unlocks, its beat.\n- **An unlock, look or Regular:** `unlocks.js`.\n\n`node tests/run.mjs rules` lints this folder: every name it refers to must exist.\nEOF\ncat > game/data/activities.js <<'EOF'\n// The numbers of every activity. Family code in game/activities reads these. \"tiers\" are in the order they unlock.\nG.SETS = {\n  body: { k: 14, c: 7, s: 4, A: 3, nf: 1.1, R: .20 },\n  flow: { k: 12, c: 6, s: 6, A: 3.2, nf: 1.3, R: .28, push: [.5, 9] },\n  stork1: { k: 12, c: 5, s: 13, A: 3, nf: 1.5, R: .24, push: [.6, 7] },\n  stork2: { k: 11, c: 4.5, s: 15, A: 3.6, nf: 1.7, R: .22, push: [.7, 6] },\n  candle: { k: 10, c: 5, s: 11, A: 1.4, nf: .8, R: .20, push: [.55, 5] },\n  rope: { k: 10, c: 3.5, s: 16, A: 3.5, nf: 1.2, R: .40, push: [.9, 5] },\n  rep: { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, sx: 8, sy: 0, A: 1, nf: 1.1, R: .3 },\n  repSide: { k: 16, c: 8, s: 0, sx: 0, sy: 8, A: 1, nf: 1.1, R: .3 },\n  plain: { k: 16, c: 8, s: 1, A: .6, nf: 1, R: .4 }\n};\nG.ACTDATA = {\n  stork: { tiers: [{ set: 'stork1', dur: 45, ringMove: 12, ringR: .22, gull: { every: 14, stay: 5, f: 2.5 } }, { set: 'stork2', dur: 45, ringMove: 12, ringR: .22, gull: { every: 11, stay: 5, f: 2.5 }, eyesClosed: true }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  flow: { tiers: [{ set: 'flow', poses: ['lowLunge', 'downDog', 'triangle', 'warrior', 'stork'], breaths: 2, cycle: 8, ringMove: 0 }, { set: 'stork1', poses: ['warrior', 'triangle', 'lowLunge', 'stork', 'kneeLift'], breaths: 2, cycle: 8, ringMove: 0 }], stars: [.5, .75, .92] },\n  candle: { tiers: [{ set: 'candle', dur: 60, thoughtEvery: 7.5, thoughtF: [3, 5] }, { set: 'candle', dur: 60, thoughtEvery: 5.5, thoughtF: [3.5, 5.5], extra: ['blender', 'goose'] }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  squat: { clip: '22_14', t0: 1.1, t1: 1.72, tgt: 1.2, tiers: [{ reps: 8, down: 2, hold: 0, up: 2 }, { reps: 12, down: 3, hold: 1, up: 1 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  pushup: { clip: 'Pushup', t0: 0, t1Frac: .5, tgt: .1, tiers: [{ reps: 6, down: 2, hold: 0, up: 2 }, { reps: 10, down: 3, hold: 1, up: 1 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  lunge: { side: true, tgt: 1.57, tiers: [{ reps: 8, down: 2, hold: 0, up: 2 }, { reps: 12, down: 3, hold: 1, up: 1 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  step: { tiers: [{ chart: 't1', bpm: 100, secs: 60, song: 'step1' }, { chart: 't2', bpm: 120, secs: 60, song: 'step2' }], stars: [.5, .75, .92] },\n  hoop: { tiers: [{ dur: 60, band: [7, 11], tossEvery: 7, perHoop: .25 }, { dur: 60, band: [8, 11], tossEvery: 5, perHoop: .3 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  jog: { tiers: [{ band: [2.6, 3.4], lapMul: 1, obstacles: 1 }, { band: [2.8, 3.3], lapMul: 1, obstacles: 1.6 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  slalom: { tiers: [{ course: 'slalom1', speed: 220 }, { course: 'slalom2', speed: 240 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  tray: { tiers: [{ dur: 60, trays: [0, 1, 2], G: 1 }, { dur: 60, trays: [1, 2, 0], G: 1.25 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] },\n  laundry: { tiers: [{ set: 'rope', spans: [240, 300, 300], speed: 19, pins: 9, gustEvery: 7, par: 56, worst: 96 }, { set: 'rope', spans: [280, 340, 340], speed: 21, pins: 14, gustEvery: 5, par: 62, worst: 96 }], stars: [.35, .65, .90] }\n};\nEOF\n","description":"Write data files: lines, poses, days, unlocks, charts, courses, trays, activity numbers"}}}
