{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011Lyru1S2mtPTyA2pBSDCuv","type":"tool_result","content":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261104-221447__x61bd7e/work/WhyFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-221447\nPROGRESS.md\nengine\ngame\nnode_modules\npackage-lock.json\npackage.json\ntests\nvendor\ngame:\nactivities\naudio.js\nbalance.js\ncore.js\ndata\nrigs.js\nrooms.js\nscenes\nui.js\n\ngame/activities:\ncandle.js\nhold.js\nhoop.js\njog.js\nlaundry.js\nrep.js\nslalom.js\nstep.js\ntray.js\n\ngame/data:\nREADME.md\nactivities.js\ncharts.js\ncourses.js\ndays.js\nlines.js\nposes.js\ntrays.js\nunlocks.js\n\ngame/scenes:\nsession.js\n  1271 total\n5216:class TileMap {\n## 14. Flow field\n\n- `new E.FlowField(map, o = {}) → flow`: new E.FlowField(map, { step: 2, climb: 0, drop: 0, jump: 0 }): distances over the tops a body can stand on (E.HEIGHTS). With no options it covers the floor (an\n- `new E.FlowField({ step, climb, drop })`: next-door cells connect when their tops differ by at most step, or going up by up to climb and down by up to drop (agents that climb walls or hop down)\n- `new E.FlowField({ jump })`: (world units) links tops across a gap that a jump clears, straight along a row or column, by map.landing's rules (up to jumpRise higher, 11, and jumpDrop lower, 18): an \n- `flow.dir(x, y, fx, fy)`: normalized ground direction to walk from (x, y) toward the target (straight at it where the field doesn't reach)\n- `flow.next(x, y)` †: the next cell to head for from (x, y): { x, y, z (its center and top), kind: 'walk' | 'climb' | 'drop' | 'jump', edge (how far (x, y) is from the side of its cell it leaves by) \n- `flow.update(x, y)`: aim the field at a world point, or at several (update([[x, y], ...]): each cell leads to the nearest, the heroes a horde chases); it rebuilds only when a target's cell or the ma\n- `flow.climb`: how much higher a next-door top may be (an agent that climbs walls)\n- `flow.d`: each cell's distance in steps to the target cell (1e9 where it can't get there), row by row\n- `flow.drop`: how much lower (an agent that hops down)\n- `flow.jump` †: the widest gap jumped (world units, 0 = none)\n- `flow.jumpDrop`, `flow.jumpRise` †: how much higher and lower a jump may land\n- `flow.map`: the map it paths over\n- `flow.step`: the height difference walked over freely (2)\n- `flow.tx = -1`, `flow.ty = -1`: the target's cell\n- `flow.version = -1`: the map's version it was built for\n\n161: * the key, open the great door, claim the crystal. THE LOOK: wall MATERIALS, ONE floorTex with PAINTED LIGHT, pitched\n196:    // floors: a tag for floorTex; block = not walkable\n314:  /* ---- FLOORS: floorTex(x, y, tag) = [r, g, b(, glow)], baked once per view ---- */\n343:    if (tag === 'bridge') return (ly < 2 && !near(cx, cy - 1, tag)) || (ly > T - 2 && !near(cx, cy + 1, tag)) ? DIRT[0] : E.tex.planks(y, x, { base: '#b07c44', dark: '#8a5c32', line: '#4a2e1a' });\n347:    if (tag === 'plaza') return e < .9 ? PLAZA.mortar : E.tex.flagstone(x, y, PLAZA, 8);\n351:    const f = E.tex.flagstone(x, y, PAVE);   // paving: moss in the seams","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a88ba50-da75-48c3-bde0-396ebfab72e9","uuid":"0c35cbc1-7e9a-4a17-8f69-7e627bd33dad","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:36:47.240Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261104-221447__x61bd7e/work/WhyFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-221447\nPROGRESS.md\nengine\ngame\nnode_modules\npackage-lock.json\npackage.json\ntests\nvendor\ngame:\nactivities\naudio.js\nbalance.js\ncore.js\ndata\nrigs.js\nrooms.js\nscenes\nui.js\n\ngame/activities:\ncandle.js\nhold.js\nhoop.js\njog.js\nlaundry.js\nrep.js\nslalom.js\nstep.js\ntray.js\n\ngame/data:\nREADME.md\nactivities.js\ncharts.js\ncourses.js\ndays.js\nlines.js\nposes.js\ntrays.js\nunlocks.js\n\ngame/scenes:\nsession.js\n  1271 total\n5216:class TileMap {\n## 14. Flow