sts/shot.py screenshots.","-- rules was 800 pass (only Laundry passive cap fix since); browser 28 pass; hub being checked (ghost send fix applied).","-","-## Next","-- Hub harness all 5 green; then exit-interview.json in work root (rebuild so About shows it); remove tests/dbg.py, tests/t*.mjs, shots; final `all`; chat reply must include Source Info + 3 feedback sections.","+## State","+All milestones M0 to M9 done. Build: `node build.mjs`. Tests: `node tests/run.mjs [rules|browser|hub|all]`."]}],"originalFile":"# Progress: Why Fit\n\n- Title: **Why Fit** (index 22 of 50, picked with Python `secrets`).\n- Dev folder: `WhyFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-221447/`\n- Final file: `WhyFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-221447.html` in this folder, plus `exit-interview.json`.\n- `cd` persists between Bash calls: always use the dev folder's absolute path.\n\n## Done so far (files in game/)\n- engine, vendor (fitclips, session, whyfit-props), harness in tests/hub; Dialog shadow patch applied.\n- core.js, balance.js, rigs.js, audio.js, ui.js, rooms.js, data/*, scenes/session.js, activities/* (all 9 family files) WRITTEN, NOT YET RUN.\n\n## State (all code written and running)\n- All scenes, dev.js, main.js, build.mjs (`node build.mjs`), tests: `node tests/run.mjs [rules|browser|hub|all]`; tests/tune.mjs prints bot scores; tests/shot.py screenshots.\n- rules was 800 pass (only Laundry passive cap fix since); browser 28 pass; hub being checked (ghost send fix applied).\n\n## Next\n- Hub harness all 5 green; then exit-interview.json in work root (rebuild so About shows it); remove tests/dbg.py, tests/t*.mjs, shots; final `all`; chat reply must include Source Info + 3 feedback sections.\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Vep2ZRLWuTndZph3pKkBxK","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
