{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjJWcoLiF7UaDG5S8Yzi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full test command now passes in one clean run: **861 passed, 0 failed, exit 0**. Rebuilding gave a byte-identical HTML file, so the handed-in game is exactly what was tested. It didn't change during this pass; only the tests did.\n\n**Addressing the stop-hook feedback:**\n- **Full `all` run:** done above, in the foreground.\n- **Pending wakeup:** cancelled.\n- **Stork tier 2 balance tone:** now checked in a browser. Eyes Closed is active, the tone's oscillator is on, and the effects bus is non-silent.\n- **Pose Viewer:** now checked. It picks a clip, scrubs, and prints a pose row.\n\n**Gaps in my own tests, now closed:**\n- **Lean bands:** tightened from ±15 to the plan's ±10, and all six rows still land inside.\n- **Damaged saves:** the old check never damaged a save. It now writes a corrupt one, which is reported as damaged, shows as an empty card and won't load, and the other members survive.\n- **Half-keyboard Class:** a real 2 key press joins a second player in a browser. In a headless test, that player has a key for every action and its right key steps its own lane.\n\n**Still not done, and can't be done on this computer:** nobody has played the game or listened to it. That includes the plan's M1 \"stop and tune here\" step, which I could only do with bots. TASK.md says anything needing the real thing is \"checked as far as it can be here, never required\", so this doesn't block the goal, but it's the first thing to check. Feel on a real controller, how the music and voices sound, and the 10-foot view on a real TV are all unconfirmed.\n\nThe Source Information and feedback sections in my previous message still stand, and the exit interview parses as JSON. The one change is the test count: 861 now, up from the 840 I gave there."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":825,"cache_read_input_tokens":453516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":825},"output_tokens":610,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a88ba50-da75-48c3-bde0-396ebfab72e9","uuid":"94264fc4-1fc2-4864-844f-ab69165de1ef","timestamp":"2026-11-05T06:24:34.469Z","request_id":"req_011CgjJWcTzjsaQ2MM9xXACT"}
